# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Unity 的场景 / 预制体 / 资产是 YAML：交给 Unity 自己管理，不做换行转换
*.unity -text
*.prefab -text
*.asset -text
*.mat -text
*.controller -text
*.anim -text
*.meta -text

# 二进制文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
